{"4190440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Orders, Captain!", "steam_appid": 4190440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/3152ba56ba567a1a2c8e1fd45436ad44.avif?t=1785616137\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras_big/3152ba56ba567a1a2c8e1fd45436ad44.webp?t=1785616137 width=1560 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/f55da9a3e97655e51fa6cbf471503479.poster.avif?t=1785616137\" width=394 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/f55da9a3e97655e51fa6cbf471503479.webm?t=1785616137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/f55da9a3e97655e51fa6cbf471503479.mp4?t=1785616137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orders, Captain!</strong> is a voice-controlled game about yelling at six barely competent crew members while enemy ships close in from every side. As the captain of a tiny cannon ship, your only hope is your microphone: call your crew by name, bark orders to load and fire the cannons, and try to keep your nerves as the sea turns into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>: the game <strong>MAY </strong>feature some &quot;tomfoolery&quot;...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/939df080a94002a9c7bafa474d78defa.poster.avif?t=1785616137\" width=394 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/939df080a94002a9c7bafa474d78defa.webm?t=1785616137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/939df080a94002a9c7bafa474d78defa.mp4?t=1785616137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/894a9ea3be65615bab4783f1e4df551b.avif?t=1785616137\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras_big/894a9ea3be65615bab4783f1e4df551b.webp?t=1785616137 width=1560 height=573 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call your crew members by their names, they are at your service at all times. After all, you are the captain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/d6368c99e7943f8b32708c99681445b2.poster.avif?t=1785616137\" width=394 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/d6368c99e7943f8b32708c99681445b2.webm?t=1785616137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/d6368c99e7943f8b32708c99681445b2.mp4?t=1785616137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/e7e306ae2884e2932ed3f778cda8369c.avif?t=1785616137\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras_big/e7e306ae2884e2932ed3f778cda8369c.webp?t=1785616137 width=1560 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve called their names, your crew members wait for your next words. Want to make Bob walk the plank and jump to his death with the kraken? or have Smithy punch Joe in the face?, the choice is yours, Captain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/9d1cf426dd2005f5c9a6f37f4ba94a46.poster.avif?t=1785616137\" width=394 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/9d1cf426dd2005f5c9a6f37f4ba94a46.webm?t=1785616137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/9d1cf426dd2005f5c9a6f37f4ba94a46.mp4?t=1785616137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/888c63cca07669313503e590423d06f6.avif?t=1785616137\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras_big/888c63cca07669313503e590423d06f6.webp?t=1785616137 width=1560 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your crew carefully to blast incoming ships before they tear your hull apart. Miss your shots or panic at the wrong time, and you’ll be the one sinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/914b10c4cc510e90cf7b7f1b1c19edec.poster.avif?t=1785616137\" width=394 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/914b10c4cc510e90cf7b7f1b1c19edec.webm?t=1785616137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/914b10c4cc510e90cf7b7f1b1c19edec.mp4?t=1785616137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the game features a singleplayer PVE mode where you try to survive as much as you can and  a multiplayer PVP up to 4 player free-for-all battle royale where each player has its own ship and crew to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there will be online matchmaking so you can join random lobbies or you can also create private matches and invite your friends, remember: a good captain sinks with his ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >also there's rum and dynamite and dry biscuits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/4de3337f2f5cd92681c79b381dd65efb.avif?t=1785616137\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras_big/4de3337f2f5cd92681c79b381dd65efb.webp?t=1785616137 width=1560 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT</strong>: &quot;allow apps to access your microphone&quot; must be turned on in your computer settings for the game to be able to detect your voice,  go to settings -&gt; privacy -&gt; microphone  and make sure its turned on</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras/3152ba56ba567a1a2c8e1fd45436ad44.avif?t=1785616137\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190440/extras_big/3152ba56ba567a1a2c8e1fd45436ad44.webp?t=1785616137 width=1560 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline